{"name": "ASTRO MAZE", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Astro maze</strong> is a puzzle game about a crew of three making their way through the intricate interior of a spaceship, while helping each other along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/7b23de3e14ecc6df4ccda5b5903cb27d.poster.avif?t=1742396472\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/7b23de3e14ecc6df4ccda5b5903cb27d.webm?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/7b23de3e14ecc6df4ccda5b5903cb27d.mp4?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes places in a spaceship that has undergone a terrible warp drive incident, which messed up the structure of the ship, causing the simple task of navigating it to become something that could challenge even the sharpest of minds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT TO DO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission, as the player \u2013 is to guide your crew through the ship <br/>and get to the bottom of it.<br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/b73f728a5657c74d0c748c111b9eb8df.poster.avif?t=1742396472\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/b73f728a5657c74d0c748c111b9eb8df.webm?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/b73f728a5657c74d0c748c111b9eb8df.mp4?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The objective</strong> is to reach a warp engine, placed behind a multitude of obstacles, caused by the incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To do that, you have to consecutively take control of each of the crewmembers, each having authority over certain ship systems.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/504466255ad627121d15d8d1228c7a6b.poster.avif?t=1742396472\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/504466255ad627121d15d8d1228c7a6b.webm?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/504466255ad627121d15d8d1228c7a6b.mp4?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This allows the crew to help each other out using a variety of inter-connected devices<br/>(levers, buttons, doors, elevators, etc).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/dea65e13dfd059167b60ca92f3c4a996.poster.avif?t=1742396472\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/dea65e13dfd059167b60ca92f3c4a996.webm?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/extras/dea65e13dfd059167b60ca92f3c4a996.mp4?t=1742396472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The warp engine will then take the crew to the next level of the ship, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">offering even more intricate puzzles and interaction elements.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Astro Maze is a brain-twisting puzzle game about cooperation. With yourself.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444370/header.jpg?t=1742396472", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Space", "Difficult", "Puzzle Platformer", "Pixel Graphics", "Logic"], "developers": "Bumbling Bastards", "publishers": "Bumbling Bastards", "release_date": "Mar 19, 2025", "price": "$8.99", "appid": "3444370", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/8B86XJ-ekOc", "first_seen": 1739923200.0, "review_rank": 1804}